thing?

14:03.622 --> 14:06.689
Uh, au contraire, uh, she's
actually dating Jeff Strongman.

14:06.691 --> 14:08.324
She's Larry's sister.

14:08.326 --> 14:11.461
Uh, oh, and, uh, I'm still the
best man in Lyndsey's wedding.

14:11.463 --> 14:13.529
Standard best man stuff:

14:13.531 --> 14:16.466
Throw a bachelor party,
give a toast at the wedding,

14:16.468 --> 14:18.268
assume a false identity

14:18.270 --> 14:21.437
and bang both the bride
and the sister of the groom.

14:21.439 --> 14:22.972
Wow. When you put it that way,

14:22.974 --> 14:25.808
it sounds like a soap opera
on Telemundo.

14:25.810 --> 14:28.211
That's what I said!

14:28.213 --> 14:30.380
What does Lyndsey think
of all this?

14:30.382 --> 14:32.515
I don't know.
Um, Alan hasn't told her

14:32.517 --> 14:34.450
and Jeff Strongman
doesn't care.

14:36.353 --> 14:39.689
How is it that Señor Strongman

14:39.691 --> 14:42.725
has two girls and I have none?

14:42.727 --> 14:44.861
Because you're not willing
to lie

14:44.863 --> 14:47.697
and treat women like crap
so you can get laid.

14:47.699 --> 14:49.365
You're a romantic.

14:49.367 --> 14:51.601
You think every girl you meet
is your soul mate.

14:51.603 --> 14:53.436
You're ready to move in
after the first date.

14:54.405 --> 14:56.239
We have a term for guys like you

14:56.241 --> 14:57.974
in the Lesbian community.

14:58.876 --> 15:00.476
It's "lesbian."

15:01.211 --> 15:03.513
♪ &lt;i>Men.&lt;/i> ♪

15:05.716 --> 15:07.016
Hey. How you doing?

15:07.018 --> 15:08.184
Great.

15:08.186 --> 15:10.420
I didn't sleep at all
last night.

15:10.422 --> 15:13.489
