about Nicole and that guy.

15:13.491 --> 15:15.458
I found my first gray hair.

15:15.460 --> 15:17.493
Not on my head.

15:17.495 --> 15:19.162
Yeah. I didn't
sleep much, either.

15:19.164 --> 15:20.963
I met up with BoobaFett420.

15:20.965 --> 15:24.267
