I want to talk to you about.

15:33.144 --> 15:34.677
Is it your pants?

15:34.679 --> 15:36.079
'Cause they're on fire.

15:37.181 --> 15:40.483
'Cause you're a liar.
What?

15:40.485 --> 15:43.186
We saw you at the restaurant
with a guy last night.

15:43.188 --> 15:45.321
You followed me?

15:45.323 --> 15:47.657
No, actually, we followed
a really handsome guy

15:47.659 --> 15:50.693
