just happened to run into you.

15:50.695 --> 15:53.396
I wanted to go
to Dave and Buster's.

15:53.398 --> 15:54.697
All right.

15:54.699 --> 15:56.332
Okay, I was waiting
for a better time

15:56.334 --> 15:59.268
to tell you this, but the guy
I had dinner with last night

15:59.270 --> 16:00.670
