16:00.672 --> 16:02.338
Oh... W... Get...

16:02.340 --> 16:03.973
Barry, Google "betrayal" and...

16:03.975 --> 16:08.010
Oh, actually, Bing "betrayal"
and let's see what comes up.

16:08.012 --> 16:09.312
(Barry types rapidly)

16:09.314 --> 16:12.048
Yep. Picture of Nicole.

16:13.016 --> 16:14.016
