16:20.325 --> 16:22.592
They're working on
the same technology that we are,

16:22.594 --> 16:25.461
and he said that I could pick
my own team and that's you guys.

16:25.463 --> 16:26.262
Oh, my God.

16:26.264 --> 16:27.397
NICOLE:
Yeah.

16:27.399 --> 16:29.599
I've never been picked
for a team.

16:29.601 --> 16:32.034
And you're gonna do this?

16:32.569 --> 16:34.103
We are so close.

16:34.105 --> 16:36.406
Well, they're a lot closer.

16:36.408 --> 16:39.509
Wow. I mean, the chances of us
