and we can change the world.

16:53.892 --> 16:57.126
Now, they're giving you an
opportunity to work for Google.

16:57.128 --> 17:00.496
I'm giving you an opportunity
to &lt;i>be&lt;/i> Google.

17:00.498 --> 17:02.999
I have to take this. I'm sorry.

17:03.001 --> 17:06.235
So you're just going
to San Francisco?

17:07.471 --> 17:09.405
Where does that leave us?

17:09.407 --> 17:12.041
Well, I mean, we were...
we were just having fun, right?

17:12.043 --> 17:14.343
Yeah, fun. Okay.

17:14.345 --> 17:16.312
Good. I'm just... I just...
(clears throat)

17:16.314 --> 17:18.714
I'm glad you're not one
of those people who thinks

17:18.716 --> 17:21.250
