17:40.804 --> 17:43.005
All right.

17:47.077 --> 17:48.411
I'm sorry, buddy.

17:48.413 --> 17:50.313
I'm here for you.

17:50.315 --> 17:52.281
Appreciate that.

17:53.383 --> 17:55.351
You know, actually...

17:55.353 --> 17:58.421
