18:43.535 --> 18:46.335
Well, I wouldn't mind
a strong man in the end.

18:46.337 --> 18:48.204
Ooh, dirty word play.

18:48.206 --> 18:49.639
I'm vibrating.

18:49.641 --> 18:50.940
I'm growing.

18:51.775 --> 18:53.709
No, uh...

18:53.711 --> 18:54.810
no, our-our table's ready.

18:54.812 --> 18:56.312
Oh, great, great.
Uh, well,

18:56.314 --> 18:57.473
let's take our wine
and have a seat.

18:57.498 --> 18:59.016
Yeah, or, um,

18:59.017 --> 19:00.750
you know, there's 20 minutes
left in happy hour.

19:00.752 --> 19:02.251
I mean, we could just stay here
and fill up

19:02.253 --> 19:04.353
